00:06:03.371 --> 00:06:05.879
Whether they're an NGO, a nonprofit,

00:06:05.879 --> 00:06:07.876
or selling bottled water,

00:06:07.876 --> 00:06:10.313
help them sell stuff, communicate,

00:06:10.313 --> 00:06:13.704
at the best possible price,
in the best possible channels,

00:06:13.704 --> 00:06:15.421
to reach the biggest possible audience

00:06:15.421 --> 00:06:16.977
to create that business result,

00:06:16.977 --> 00:06:18.139
and more importantly than that,

00:06:18.139 --> 00:06:19.926
let's treat each other tremendously well

00:06:19.926 --> 00:06:22.108
and have a real, real community here,

00:06:22.108 --> 00:06:23.920
because continuity is what I'm going for,

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.430
because continuity builds speed.

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:26.847
One of the things that
people don't understand

00:06:26.847 --> 00:06:27.782
about businesses,

00:06:27.782 --> 00:06:28.872
when you have continuity--

00:06:28.872 --> 00:06:31.266
