00:06:32.565 --> 00:06:34.633
but when your offensive line,
when all five of those guys

00:06:34.633 --> 00:06:36.723
play the whole season together,

00:06:36.723 --> 00:06:38.627
'cause they work as
one, it's really magic,

00:06:38.627 --> 00:06:40.622
