00:06:59.785 --> 00:07:02.734
not because I'm some weird
evil, like, cult overlord,

00:07:02.734 --> 00:07:06.541
it's because continuity breeds speed.

00:07:06.541 --> 00:07:08.352
And I value speed more than anything.

00:07:08.352 --> 00:07:10.419
