00:16:28.396 --> 00:16:29.650
- Yeah it is pretty awesome.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:30.950
- I would so kill it if I had that hair.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:34.665
Um, yeah, I mean, look, Unspoken Wounds,

00:16:34.665 --> 00:16:37.614
I think that the number one
piece of advice I could give you

00:16:37.614 --> 00:16:40.586
is make them feel like
they can actually do it.

00:16:40.586 --> 00:16:41.654
