00:16:41.654 --> 00:16:45.810
you as their parent,
creating that permission,

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:48.550
for you to say yes you can is real.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:51.173
Now, no eighth place trophies.

00:16:51.173 --> 00:16:53.820
Yes you can, but when
they put out something

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.793
and everybody on YouTube says it sucks,

00:16:55.793 --> 00:16:57.071
you look at them and say,

00:16:57.071 --> 00:16:59.163
the market says you suck!

00:16:59.163 --> 00:17:00.846
