Parented, when I write it,

00:17:21.079 --> 00:17:23.587
transitions my career, I really do.

00:17:23.587 --> 00:17:25.397
Because I'm passionate about this.

00:17:25.397 --> 00:17:27.132
Like, as I'm getting closer,
and I have a six-year-old

00:17:27.132 --> 00:17:28.266
daughter and I'm meeting other parents,

00:17:28.266 --> 00:17:29.636
